{"id":"55d04ac829aa6988","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-spectral-sequence.md","title":"Spectral Sequence","display":"df-spectral-sequence — Spectral Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-spectral-sequence","aliases":["58-df-spectral-sequence"],"display":"df-spectral-sequence — Spectral Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-spectral-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-spectral-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-spectral-sequence — Spectral Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,d\\in V\">\\(E,d\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded page-object and differential families)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\{\\langle r,p,q\\rangle:r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\}\">\\(J=\\{\\langle r,p,q\\rangle:r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpectralSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SpectralSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SpectralSequence}_S(E,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(E,J,\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,J,\\operatorname{ran}(d))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\langle r,p,q\\rangle\\in J\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(d(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle),E(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle),E(\\langle r,p+r,q-r+1\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land d(\\langle r,p+r,q-r+1\\rangle)\\circ d(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land E(\\langle r+1,p,q\\rangle)\\cong\\ker d(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle)/\\operatorname{im}d(\\langle r,p-r,q+r-1\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SpectralSequence}_S(E,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(E,J,\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,J,\\operatorname{ran}(d))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\langle r,p,q\\rangle\\in J\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(d(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle),E(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle),E(\\langle r,p+r,q-r+1\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land d(\\langle r,p+r,q-r+1\\rangle)\\circ d(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land E(\\langle r+1,p,q\\rangle)\\cong\\ker d(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle)/\\operatorname{im}d(\\langle r,p-r,q+r-1\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Spectral sequences compute homology via successive approximations.  Pages and differentials are set-coded functions on an explicit index set.</li>\n<li>They arise in many contexts: Leray-Serre, Adams, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"J=\\{\\langle r,p,q\\rangle:r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land p,q\\in\\mathbb Z\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SpectralSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}spectral\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SpectralSequence}_S(E,d)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Function}(E,J,\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,J,\\operatorname{ran}(d))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\langle r,p,q\\rangle\\in J\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(d(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle),E(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle),E(\\langle r,p+r,q-r+1\\rangle))\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land d(\\langle r,p+r,q-r+1\\rangle)\\circ d(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle)=0\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land E(\\langle r+1,p,q\\rangle)\\cong\\ker d(\\langle r,p,q\\rangle)/\\operatorname{im}d(\\langle r,p-r,q+r-1\\rangle)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1371,"backlinks":[{"id":"12ff4099e35b4ab6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-spectral-sequence.md|58-df-spectral-sequence]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}